      en: ["Founded in 597 AD by Saint Augustine, the first Archbishop of Canterbury.", "The site of Thomas Becket's murder on December 29, 1170.", "The reconstruction of the choir after 1174 introduced Gothic style to England.", "Designated as a UNESCO World Heritage Site in 1988.", "The cathedral's nave stretches to a length of approximately 160 meters.", "It houses the tombs of King Henry IV and Edward the Black Prince."],
