      en: ["Founded in 1068 as a wooden motte-and-bailey fort by William the Conqueror.", "The stone fortifications were largely expanded during the 14th century.", "Caesar's Tower stands at 39 meters and is the castle's tallest fortification.", "The Tussauds Group purchased the castle from the Greville family in 1978.", "The extensive gardens were landscaped by Capability Brown starting in 1749.", "It features the world's largest working trebuchet, a massive medieval siege engine."],
      es: ["Posee la torre Guy's Tower de 39 metros de altura", "Jardines diseñados por Capability Brown", "Trabuquete funcional más grande", "Habitado durante más de 900 años"],
      pt: ["Possui a Guy's Tower de 39 metros de altura", "Jardins projetados por Capability Brown", "Maior trabuco funcional", "Habitado por mais de 900 anos"],
