      en: ["Largest Roman home in Britain, featuring approximately 100 rooms.", "Built around 75 AD, possibly for the local king Togidubnus.", "Home to the famous 'Boy on a Dolphin' mosaic floor.", "The formal gardens are replanted using original Roman plant species.", "Rediscovered by accident in 1960 during water pipe excavations.", "The palace was permanently abandoned after a fire in 270 AD."],
