      en: ["First church founded in 1030 by Tovi the Proud.", "King Harold II consecrated a magnificent new church in 1060.", "It was the final monastery in England to be dissolved, in 1540.", "The nave measures 33 meters in length and is pure Norman style.", "The iconic painted ceiling was restored in the 19th century.", "The crypt preserves remains of the original Saxon structure."],
